// shader-differential — curated regression row for t_a1f43b12 (P1, fixed
// 6b2f010): the literal MULTIPLICAND of a fused MAD.  Until 2026-09-02 the
// default path emitted it as {0, 0, 0, 0} (the Mul matcher stored the
// non-varying operand in a field the MAD emitter read as a uniform to be
// patched; nothing patches a literal), so the output collapsed to the
// addend: 0.5 everywhere, exit 0, container written.  Found by the VP
// rig's coverage-FP instrument rows on their first boot.  Judged against
// the reference under the shared VP: TEXCOORD0 varies, so a zeroed
// multiplier paints a constant where a ramp belongs.
void main(float4 v : TEXCOORD0, out float4 color : COLOR)
{
    color = v * float4(0.5f, 0.5f, 0.5f, 0.5f) + float4(0.5f, 0.5f, 0.5f, 0.5f);
}
